<title>ITALY: Italian mutual funds post Oct inflow.</title>
<headline>Italian mutual funds post Oct inflow.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian investment funds had a net inflow of 7.953 trillion lire in October, compared with a net inflow of 3.408 trillion lire in September, Assogestioni, the industry body said.</p>
<p>				   October 1996  September 1996</p>
<p> Redemptions (bln lire)	6,753	     4,467</p>
<p> Subscriptions		  14,706	     7,875</p>
<p> Net inflow, outflow (-) from:</p>
<p> Equity funds		     -914		-532</p>
<p>     of which Italian	   -159		-106</p>
<p> Bond funds			9,141	     4,213</p>
<p> Mixed funds			-274		-273</p>
<p>-- Milan bureau +392 66129589</p>
</text>
